{"parse":{"title":"个性/白金血裔","pageid":7955,"revid":19246,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E7%99%BD%E9%87%91%E8%A1%80%E8%A3%94&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E7%99%BD%E9%87%91%E8%A1%80%E8%A3%94&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E7%99%BD%E9%87%91%E8%A1%80%E8%A3%94&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>白金血裔</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E7.99.BD.E9.87.91.E8.A1.80.E8.A3.94\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"白金血裔\"><b>白金血裔</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">个性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"个性 白金狮子.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f6/p98s2cdv2jga7ze6e41up44gzcn9twy.png/80px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E7%99%BD%E9%87%91%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f6/p98s2cdv2jga7ze6e41up44gzcn9twy.png/120px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E7%99%BD%E9%87%91%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/f/f6/p98s2cdv2jga7ze6e41up44gzcn9twy.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />白金血裔\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰原野性\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">冰原野性</font></span></span>]。拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"高级无视守护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">高级无视守护</font></span></span>]效果。<br />\n✦不具有能量值，自身的技能能量消耗为<font color=\"#58cb48\">0</font>。<br />\n✦拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"狮血\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">狮血</font></span></span>]。行动开始时或任意行动后，若[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"狮血\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">狮血</font></span></span>]达到<font color=\"#ed7950\">10</font>点，则自动释放[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">唤醒血脉·白金狮子</font></span>]，进入[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"金狮形态\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">金狮形态</font></span></span>]。<br />\n✦行动开始时，获得<font color=\"#58cb48\">2</font>点[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"狮血\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">狮血</font></span></span>]；处于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">人形态</span>]时，主动攻击后获得<font color=\"#58cb48\">1</font>点。<br />\n✦攻防属性提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">5%</font>。基础魔攻值的<font color=\"#d68fe2\">10%</font>附加在物防和魔防上。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br /><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%BD%97%E6%A0%BC%E5%A6%AE%E8%BE%BE\" title=\"角色图鉴库/罗格妮达\"><img alt=\"头像 罗格妮达.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/b3/c4fwdlbtqsacncted6tng2xslvprr4g.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">罗格妮达</font></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰原野性\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">冰原野性</font></span></span>]。拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;whi